docs {
  # Get All Stocks (XML)
  
  Fetches the live list of all securities and indices from the Philippine Stock Exchange (PSE) in JAXB-compatible XML format.
  
  **URL**: `GET /stocks.xml`
  
  **Response**:
  Returns an XML document with a root element `<stocks:stocks>` containing `<stocks:stock>` items.
}
